==Slateport City==
===A Huge Discovery!===
When you return to [[Slateport City]], head to the northeast part of town. Outside the Slateport Harbor building, you find [[Captain Stern]] filming an interview with [[Gabby and Ty]] in front of a small crowd. Once they leave, he informs you that the most recent seafloor expedition made a huge discovery: an underwater cavern on {{rt|128|Hoenn}}! Stern believes it to be the habitat of a Pokémon said to have long been extinct. Just then, a voice addresses [[Captain Stern]] through a megaphone. It's [[Maxie]]{{sup/3|R}}/[[Archie]]{{sup/3|S}}, announcing how his team will be taking control of Stern's submarine!

===Slateport Harbor===
Follow Stern into the building to find the boss and one of his subordinates. He sympathizes with you for the effort it took to follow him here from [[Mt. Pyre]], but declares that no one can stop them. He wonders aloud if you will follow them back to their hideout in [[Lilycove City]], then the two men board the submarine and make their escape. Stern asks why they would steal the submarine, believing that they can't possibly be after the slumbering Pokémon at the bottom of the sea...

==Lilycove City==
[[File:Lilycove City RS.png|thumb|Lilycove City]]

[[Lilycove City]] is located between {{rt|121|Hoenn}} to the west and {{rt|124|Hoenn}} to the east. The [[Lilycove Department Store]] and [[Lilycove Museum]] stand on a hill on the city's north side. The [[Cove Lily Motel]], Master Rank [[Pokémon Contest|Contest Hall]], and Lilycove Harbor are found to the south. A large rock formation houses a cave just offshore.

