After the battle, you learn that your friend has been making good progress on the Pokédex, and plans to visit [[Littleroot Town]] again soon in order to show [[Professor Birch]]. She/He asks if you will be taking the Pokémon League challenge, and promises to complete the Pokédex while you're busy collecting Badges. The Trainer then uses {{m|Fly}} to leave the city.

===Lilycove Department Store===
The [[Lilycove Department Store]] is the largest shop in [[Hoenn]]. Nearly any item a Trainer could want can be found here.

====1F: Service Counter====
[[File:Lilycove Department Store 1F RSE.png|thumb|Lilycove Department Store, 1F]]

The {{DL|Lilycove Department Store|First floor|first floor}} holds the service counter. There are two receptionists: the one on the left greets visitors, while the one on the right runs the [[Loto-ID|Pokémon Lottery Corner]].

=====Lottery Corner=====
All visitors may draw a single Pokémon Loto Ticket per day. If the Loto Ticket's number matches the full [[Trainer ID number|ID number]] of any of their Pokémon, they win the grand prize. The five-digit number is generated randomly. Other prizes are awarded for partial matches.

